—God, he said quietly. Isn’t the sea what Algy calls it: a great sweet mother? The snotgreen sea. The scrotumtightening sea. Epi oinopa ponton. Ah, Dedalus, the Greeks. I must teach you. You must read them in the original. Thalatta! Thalatta! She is our great sweet mother. Come and look.','James Joyce · Ulysses · Shakespeare and Company, Paris, 1922 · Chapter I','526015dd2e238237f14129a76e94b3e4f8e4e27ad07b48d4d4d5a2df2db7dadb','21f5ddc16c42981666952e8d2fe36af645a8542aa0034417c672e91792c00cf9','{"highlightTerms":["Dublin bay"],"reviewedAt":"2026-11-06","translationReview":{"it":"No verified reusable version located","fr":"No verified reusable version located","es":"No verified reusable version located"}}'::jsonb) on conflict do nothing;

—Do you wish me to tell you? he asked.

—Yes, what is it? Buck Mulligan answered. I don’t remember anything.','James Joyce · Ulysses · Shakespeare and Company, Paris, 1922 · Chapter I','526015dd2e238237f14129a76e94b3e4f8e4e27ad07b48d4d4d5a2df2db7dadb','21f5ddc16c42981666952e8d2fe36af645a8542aa0034417c672e91792c00cf9','{"highlightTerms":["Bray Head"],"reviewedAt":"2026-11-06","translationReview":{"it":"No verified reusable version located","fr":"No verified reusable version located","es":"No verified reusable version located"}}'::jsonb) on conflict do nothing;

—She’s making for Bullock harbour.

The boatman nodded towards the north of the bay with some disdain.

—There’s five fathoms out there, he said. It’ll be swept up that way when the tide comes in about one. It’s nine days today.','James Joyce · Ulysses · Shakespeare and Company, Paris, 1922 · Chapter I','526015dd2e238237f14129a76e94b3e4f8e4e27ad07b48d4d4d5a2df2db7dadb','21f5ddc16c42981666952e8d2fe36af645a8542aa0034417c672e91792c00cf9','{"highlightTerms":["Bullock harbour"],"reviewedAt":"2026-11-06","translationReview":{"it":"No verified reusable version located","fr":"No verified reusable version located","es":"No verified reusable version located"}}'::jsonb) on conflict do nothing;

—Down in Westmeath. With the Bannons.

—Still there? I got a card from Bannon. Says he found a sweet young thing down there. Photo girl he calls her.

—Shapshot, eh? Brief exposure.','James Joyce · Ulysses · Shakespeare and Company, Paris, 1922 · Chapter I','526015dd2e238237f14129a76e94b3e4f8e4e27ad07b48d4d4d5a2df2db7dadb','21f5ddc16c42981666952e8d2fe36af645a8542aa0034417c672e91792c00cf9','{"highlightTerms":["Westmeath"],"reviewedAt":"2026-11-06","translationReview":{"it":"No verified reusable version located","fr":"No verified reusable version located","es":"No verified reusable version located"}}'::jsonb) on conflict do nothing;

—Our mighty mother, Buck Mulligan said.

He turned abruptly his great searching eyes from the sea to Stephen’s face.','James Joyce · Ulysses · Shakespeare and Company, Paris, 1922 · Chapter I','526015dd2e238237f14129a76e94b3e4f8e4e27ad07b48d4d4d5a2df2db7dadb','21f5ddc16c42981666952e8d2fe36af645a8542aa0034417c672e91792c00cf9','{"highlightTerms":["harbour mouth of Kingstown"],"reviewedAt":"2026-11-06","translationReview":{"it":"No verified reusable version located","fr":"No verified reusable version located","es":"No verified reusable version located"}}'::jsonb) on conflict do nothing;
